-- Translate remaining Bangla copy (FAQ answers, PracticeKoro metric, services) to English. Safe to re-run.

UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Most projects go live **within 5 to 7 working days**. A simple 1-page Starter website can be ready in 3–4 days. Before going live, you’ll get a private preview link to check it on your own phone.' WHERE question = 'How fast will my website be live?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Not at all. Domain guidance, hosting, SSL security, mobile optimisation, Google setup and testing — I handle everything. Just send your business details and photos on WhatsApp.' WHERE question = 'Do I need any technical knowledge?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'If you already have a domain, we connect that one. If not, I’ll guide you to buy one in your own name (usually ₹600–₹800 a year), so it always stays yours.' WHERE question = 'Do I need to buy a domain and hosting myself?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Yes. I’m based in Manbazar, Purulia, and work with businesses across West Bengal and all over India. Everything happens over WhatsApp, phone calls and screen-sharing.' WHERE question = 'Do you work with businesses outside Purulia?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'It’s a system that regularly brings people interested in your service to you — through ads, Google and your website — and captures their name, phone number and what they need, so you can turn them into customers.' WHERE question = 'What exactly is lead generation?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'When someone taps your website or ad, WhatsApp opens with a ready-made message. An auto-reply instantly welcomes them with a menu (services, prices, booking, timings) and saves their details. You’ll never lose a customer just because you were busy.' WHERE question = 'How does WhatsApp automation bring me more customers?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Yes. The automation only handles the first greeting, the menu and lead capture. You or your staff can step into any chat and talk whenever you like.' WHERE question = 'Can I still chat normally with my customers?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Every lead is automatically saved to a private Google Sheet — with name, phone, what they need and where they came from. So you can follow up and see what’s working.' WHERE question = 'Where do my leads go?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'For a local business targeting a 5–15 km radius, **₹200 to ₹400 a day** is usually enough to start getting regular enquiries. We start small, measure, then scale what works.' WHERE question = 'How much should I spend on ads?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'No — ad spend is paid directly to Meta from your own account, so you stay in control. Our fee covers setup, creatives, ad copy, targeting and tracking.' WHERE question = 'Is the ad budget included in your price?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = '50% advance to start work, and the remaining 50% before launch, only after you’ve seen and approved the design. We accept UPI and bank transfer.' WHERE question = 'What are your payment terms?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'No. The core packages are one-time payments. Monthly services like ad management or maintenance are completely optional — only if you want them.' WHERE question = 'Are there hidden monthly fees?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'The Suite covers setup, design, copy and tracking. Ad spend goes directly to Meta from your own account, so you stay in control. Most local businesses start with ₹200–₹400 a day.' WHERE question = 'Is the ad budget included in the Full Digital Suite?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Yes. You can start with Starter and move up to Growth or Full Suite later — you only pay the difference for the new work.' WHERE question = 'Can I upgrade later?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Every package includes free support after launch (30–60 days, depending on the plan). Price changes, new photos, Puja or festival offer banners — just send a WhatsApp message.' WHERE question = 'What if I need changes later?';
UPDATE faqs SET answer = 'Yes. Every site is built SEO-ready, submitted to Google Search Console and connected to your Google Business Profile, so nearby customers can find you.' WHERE question = 'Will my website show up on Google?';
UPDATE projects SET metrics = REPLACE(metrics, '"value":"বাংলা"', '"value":"Bengali"') WHERE slug = 'practicekoro';
